/// the normal call handler; no dedicated VM opcode.  Not treated as
/// minnum/maxnum.  bfloat/vector/constrained stay rejected.  Listed
/// scalar IEEE fp128 minimum/maximum use isSupportedFP128MinMaxIntrinsic.
