/// Well-shaped scalar fcvtzs/fcvtzu.  Half needs last-token
/// +fullfp16.  f32/f64 need no extra token.  Re-emitted via
/// CallDescriptor / float in, integer out.  No FMF (integer
/// result).  No ImmediateArguments.  No new opcode.
